1
00:00:00,179 --> 00:00:02,249
(Penny:)that makes you
a little insecure.

2
00:00:02,247 --> 00:00:03,877
(Leonard:)Well, I can't believe
you'd say that.

3
00:00:03,882 --> 00:00:07,452
(Leonard:)You know how insecure I am
about my insecurities.

4
00:00:09,054 --> 00:00:10,654
(Penny:)You know what?
I'm sorry.

5
00:00:10,656 --> 00:00:12,556
(Penny:)It's stupid
to fight over money.

6
00:00:12,558 --> 00:00:14,528
(Leonard:)Yeah, I'm sorry, too.
We're about to share

7
00:00:14,526 --> 00:00:16,096
(Leonard:)the rest of our lives together.

8
00:00:16,095 --> 00:00:18,365
It's our money--
who cares who has it?

9
00:00:18,364 --> 00:00:21,034
Ugh! You're right--
who cares? Mm.

10
00:00:22,001 --> 00:00:24,131
(Penny:)Get that money
out of my back pocket

11
00:00:24,136 --> 00:00:26,366
(Penny:)or I will break your fingers.

12
00:00:28,674 --> 00:00:30,604
(Raj:)Huh. All this time
I never knew

13
00:00:30,609 --> 00:00:32,239
(Raj:)there were steam tunnels
down here.

14
00:00:32,244 --> 00:00:34,174
(Amy:)Most universities
have them.

15
00:00:34,179 --> 00:00:36,909
(Amy:)When I was an undergrad,
I spent three days in one

16
00:00:36,915 --> 00:00:38,215
(Amy:)pledging a sorority.

17
00:00:39,184 --> 00:00:41,254
(Raj:)Did you get in?

18
00:00:41,253 --> 00:00:42,783
(Amy:)No. They forgot I was there.

19
00:00:42,788 --> 00:00:45,088
(Amy:)But it really opened up
my pores.

20
00:00:46,592 --> 00:00:48,192
(Sheldon:)Well, according
to my research,

21
00:00:48,193 --> 00:00:51,093
(Sheldon:)the steam tunnels
below this access point

22
00:00:51,096 --> 00:00:54,366
(Sheldon:)should be the closest
analog to the mines.

23
00:00:54,366 --> 00:00:55,696
(Raj:)This is gonna be
so much more accurate

24
00:00:55,701 --> 00:00:56,871
(Raj:)than the steam room at the gym.

25
00:00:56,869 --> 00:00:58,199
(Sheldon:)Plus, there's almost no chance

26
00:00:58,203 --> 00:01:00,973
(Sheldon:)we'll see any
of our coworkers half naked.

